          "why_it_matters": "Benjamin's alto sound is the reason to keep this on RADAR: hard attack, funk pocket and a vocabulary that can move through jazz, R&B, hip-hop and Latin language without turning the horn into decoration. Her Zankel Hall debut catches that voice in Carnegie's smaller room just a few months after We Dream, so the instrument and the current band language should matter more than the prestige of the address.",
